1
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:05,088
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,764
[laughs]

3
00:00:32,907 --> 00:00:35,410
[Diego] <i>Listen to me. We don't</i>
<i>have to kill each other.</i>

4
00:00:35,493 --> 00:00:39,372
<i>If we work together, we can get</i>
<i>Auntie Camia and Lily back.</i>

5
00:00:39,456 --> 00:00:40,999
<i>We're going to turn the tables on them.</i>

6
00:00:41,082 --> 00:00:43,376
<i>I'll give you what you want!</i>

7
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:44,294
<i>Diego!</i>

8
00:00:44,377 --> 00:00:45,462
[gunshot]

9
00:00:45,545 --> 00:00:46,379
[Helena] <i>Finally!</i>

10
00:00:46,463 --> 00:00:48,548
<i>Helena, you monster!</i>

11
00:00:48,631 --> 00:00:51,384
<i>Let me see my daughter before I die!</i>

12
00:00:51,468 --> 00:00:53,428
<i>I won't let you kill my mother!</i>

13
00:00:53,511 --> 00:00:56,681
<i>This is the end of the game. Game over!</i>

14
00:00:56,765 --> 00:00:59,517
<i>No! Kill me, instead!</i>

15
00:00:59,601 --> 00:01:01,394
[Helena] <i>Burn her! Burn that witch!</i>

16
00:01:01,478 --> 00:01:02,812
-[Arnaldo] <i>I said, no!</i>
-<i>No!</i>

17
00:01:02,896 --> 00:01:05,774
<i>Romulo! I said, stop it!</i>

18
00:01:05,857 --> 00:01:09,861
<i>You, Helena, are not the only</i>
<i>player in this playground!</i>

19
00:01:09,944 --> 00:01:12,113
<i>Remember, we are a family.</i>

20
00:01:12,197 --> 00:01:16,242
<i>And we have to come up with the</i>
<i>final decision together as one.</i>

21
00:01:16,326 --> 00:01:18,661
[Diego] <i>Now, bring Lily to me,</i>
<i>just as you promised!</i>

22
00:01:18,745 --> 00:01:21,372
<i>You will never see Lily Cruz alive again.</i>

23
00:01:21,456 --> 00:01:23,083
[goon] <i>Let's kill him</i>
<i>before he tries to escape.</i>

24
00:01:23,166 --> 00:01:24,918
[Magbanua] <i>We need to wait</i>
<i>for our bosses' orders.</i>

25
00:01:25,001 --> 00:01:26,044
<i>But keep an eye on him.</i>

26
00:01:26,127 --> 00:01:27,796
<i>-I know you're watching me!</i>
-[Julio]<i> We'll drive her insane.</i>

27
00:01:27,879 --> 00:01:30,089
<i>Just as she did my grandson.</i>

28
00:01:30,173 --> 00:01:33,301
<i>And then we will be</i>
<i>laughing our heads off.</i>

29
00:01:33,384 --> 00:01:36,846
<i>Because we Ardientes</i>
<i>always get the last laugh.</i>

30
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:39,182
[Magbanua] <i>Who disposed of Damian's body?</i>

31
00:01:39,265 --> 00:01:40,600
[goon] <i>Ramirez and Salazar did.</i>

32
00:01:41,267 --> 00:01:42,060
[gunshots]

33
00:01:42,143 --> 00:01:43,436
<i>Where are Lily and Camia?</i>

34
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:44,437
<i>I don't know.</i>

35
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:47,816
-<i>Papa, what just happened?</i>
-[Julio] <i>I don't know!</i>

36
00:01:49,734 --> 00:01:50,985
[electricity buzzing]

37
00:01:53,613 --> 00:01:54,531
<i>Mom!</i>

38
00:01:54,614 --> 00:01:58,284
<i>Lily, I'm here! Lily! Lily!</i>

39
00:01:58,368 --> 00:01:59,869
<i>Where's my mother?!</i>

40
00:01:59,953 --> 00:02:01,788
[gunshots]

41
00:02:05,083 --> 00:02:06,084
Lily!

42
00:02:06,334 --> 00:02:08,419
You hear Lily?

43
00:02:08,503 --> 00:02:09,838
Bring Lily out!

44
00:02:10,964 --> 00:02:12,632
[tense music playing]

45
00:02:20,098 --> 00:02:21,099
There!

46
00:02:24,018 --> 00:02:25,019
[Lily shouting]

47
00:02:27,063 --> 00:02:28,064
There's Lily!

48
00:02:29,357 --> 00:02:30,358
[goon] Here she is!

49
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:34,445
Your daughter's here.
Go ahead and hug her!

50
00:02:35,029 --> 00:02:36,239
[Camia sobbing]

51
00:02:38,074 --> 00:02:39,784
[tense music playing]

52
00:02:45,331 --> 00:02:48,084
Monsters! Monsters!

53
00:02:48,167 --> 00:02:49,168
Go on.

54
00:02:50,503 --> 00:02:51,671
Leave us.

55
00:02:53,006 --> 00:02:54,674
[tense music playing]

56
00:02:59,304 --> 00:03:00,722
-Lily Cruz!
-[gunshots]

57
00:03:00,805 --> 00:03:01,598
[gunshots]

58
00:03:07,395 --> 00:03:08,313
[gunshots]

59
00:03:10,690 --> 00:03:11,691
[groans]

60
00:03:14,235 --> 00:03:17,155
[goon] You should thank the
Ardientes for keeping you alive.

61
00:03:17,238 --> 00:03:19,032
You'd be dead if it were up to me.

62
00:03:19,115 --> 00:03:21,159
[tense music continues playing]

63
00:03:21,242 --> 00:03:22,368
Remember this?

64
00:03:24,871 --> 00:03:26,080
Remember this?

65
00:03:28,041 --> 00:03:29,709
I'm not done with you yet.

66
00:03:32,503 --> 00:03:34,297
[tense music playing]

67
00:03:35,632 --> 00:03:36,507
[gun cocks]

68
00:03:36,591 --> 00:03:37,508
[goon] Don't!

69
00:03:38,134 --> 00:03:39,010
[grunting]

70
00:03:41,095 --> 00:03:42,555
[tense music playing]

71
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:43,806
[Camia cries]

72
00:03:55,068 --> 00:03:56,694
This is all your fault!

73
00:03:56,778 --> 00:03:58,988
-Mine?!
-[Helena] All our guards are down.

74
00:03:59,072 --> 00:03:59,948
Even Romulo's dead!

75
00:04:00,031 --> 00:04:03,451
If you're so brilliant,
what's your next move, huh?

76
00:04:03,534 --> 00:04:05,954
Answer me! Answer me!

77
00:04:07,830 --> 00:04:09,499
[tense music playing]

78
00:04:15,964 --> 00:04:16,965
[gunshot]

79
00:04:19,050 --> 00:04:19,884
[gunshot]

80
00:04:22,595 --> 00:04:24,889
[screams in frustration]

81
00:04:28,309 --> 00:04:30,019
Do you really think you could escape?

82
00:04:30,353 --> 00:04:31,354
[Camia grunts]

83
00:04:31,646 --> 00:04:33,064
[Camia screaming]

84
00:04:35,566 --> 00:04:38,987
Don't touch me, you bastard!
Get off of me!

85
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:40,655
[goon] I'm not done with you!

86
00:04:42,657 --> 00:04:44,325
[tense music playing]

87
00:05:15,064 --> 00:05:16,733
[tense music playing]

88
00:05:22,739 --> 00:05:25,074
What are we gonna do?
What are we gonna do?!

89
00:05:27,076 --> 00:05:28,953
-[Emilia] Ma.
-I think you should meditate.

90
00:05:29,037 --> 00:05:30,121
Calm down.

91
00:05:30,204 --> 00:05:33,082
Calm down?! This is all your fault!

92
00:05:33,166 --> 00:05:36,794
Yes, you kidnapped Lily.
But you wanted to play games!

93
00:05:37,170 --> 00:05:39,005
And now, we're about to lose.

94
00:05:39,088 --> 00:05:41,174
You just wanna drag us all down!

95
00:05:41,257 --> 00:05:43,885
Don't you raise your voice at Arnaldo!

96
00:05:44,260 --> 00:05:46,054
That's right! Keep tolerating him!

97
00:05:46,137 --> 00:05:48,014
-Of course! What do you want me to do?
-What?!

98
00:05:48,097 --> 00:05:50,475
Want me to listen to Emilia,
instead? Is that it?

99
00:05:50,558 --> 00:05:53,186
-Stop spoiling him!
-Yes! I'll do what I want!

100
00:05:53,269 --> 00:05:54,312
Look what happened! Why?

101
00:05:54,395 --> 00:05:59,901
Stop! Stop! Look! Look!
Lily Cruz has escaped!

102
00:06:00,318 --> 00:06:02,528
What are we going to do now?
Papa, do something!

103
00:06:05,698 --> 00:06:07,075
[tense music playing]

104
00:06:10,536 --> 00:06:11,913
What now? Huh?

105
00:06:12,288 --> 00:06:14,749
<i>Are you enjoying the show, Ardientes?</i>

106
00:06:15,833 --> 00:06:17,710
<i>Go ahead and have fun watching!</i>

107
00:06:17,794 --> 00:06:21,255
Because once I get out of here,
along with my mother,

108
00:06:21,339 --> 00:06:23,800
I'll show you the meaning of fear!

109
00:06:24,092 --> 00:06:25,802
[tense music playing]

110
00:06:36,687 --> 00:06:39,565
Wait for me, Ardientes. I'm coming.

111
00:06:42,276 --> 00:06:43,986
[tense music playing]

112
00:06:49,826 --> 00:06:52,161
[brooding music playing]

113
00:07:08,511 --> 00:07:10,346
[Julio] <i>Watch! Watch, Lily Cruz!</i>

114
00:07:15,476 --> 00:07:17,145
[brooding music playing]

115
00:07:48,301 --> 00:07:49,302
Lily.

116
00:07:53,473 --> 00:07:56,267
[suspenseful music building]

117
00:07:56,809 --> 00:07:57,727
[groans]

118
00:08:00,188 --> 00:08:01,189
[groaning]

119
00:08:03,065 --> 00:08:04,984
[breathes heavily]

120
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:10,990
Lily. Lily!
What did you do to my daughter?

121
00:08:11,782 --> 00:08:14,619
[wailing] Lily! Lily!

122
00:08:20,374 --> 00:08:21,667
[glass breaking]

123
00:08:22,835 --> 00:08:24,670
If you didn't stop me,

124
00:08:24,754 --> 00:08:26,589
Lily Cruz would've bitten the dust by now!

125
00:08:28,424 --> 00:08:32,553
I've run out of men and patience
because of that woman!

126
00:08:33,638 --> 00:08:36,224
And she's coming here,
so we need to be careful.

127
00:08:36,307 --> 00:08:37,475
You know how she is.

128
00:08:37,725 --> 00:08:40,186
She might just walk on water
or grow wings.

129
00:08:40,269 --> 00:08:41,979
-[Julio laughs]
-Like some kind of superhero.

130
00:08:42,063 --> 00:08:44,190
Okay, by now, I'm so tired of saying this,

131
00:08:44,273 --> 00:08:46,275
but please, calm down.

132
00:08:46,359 --> 00:08:48,319
Look, you even broke Grandpa's
favorite vase.

133
00:08:48,903 --> 00:08:51,322
She's alone, isn't she?

134
00:08:51,405 --> 00:08:53,282
And, besides she has no idea where we are.

135
00:08:53,366 --> 00:08:54,575
She doesn't even know where Camia is.

136
00:08:55,409 --> 00:08:57,370
Before she can open the doors
to this house,

137
00:08:57,453 --> 00:08:59,956
our men would've showered her
with bullets.

138
00:09:00,289 --> 00:09:01,457
Don't be scared.

139
00:09:01,541 --> 00:09:02,416
[whistles]

140
00:09:02,917 --> 00:09:03,876
[Julio] Foul.

141
00:09:04,794 --> 00:09:08,756
Ardiente men are born to rule.

142
00:09:09,340 --> 00:09:14,178
I still have everything under
control, so please trust me.

143
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:20,810
No! This is my game!
And everybody plays by my rules!

144
00:09:21,310 --> 00:09:22,395
[frustrated] Bullshit.

145
00:09:23,229 --> 00:09:24,230
[sighs]

146
00:09:24,522 --> 00:09:26,190
[tense music playing]

147
00:09:39,537 --> 00:09:41,163
Are you going to talk?

148
00:09:41,247 --> 00:09:42,206
[Magbanua scoffs]

149
00:09:42,290 --> 00:09:43,874
Or should I just break your skull open?

150
00:09:44,417 --> 00:09:46,168
[coughing]

151
00:09:49,130 --> 00:09:50,131
Well?

152
00:09:51,090 --> 00:09:53,426
You think you're so tough, huh?!

153
00:09:54,468 --> 00:09:57,305
-[Damian fires shot]
-[screaming in pain]

154
00:09:57,388 --> 00:09:59,348
[Magbanua laughs, groans]

155
00:10:00,224 --> 00:10:02,393
[groans, laughs]

156
00:10:06,981 --> 00:10:09,859
Even if you kill me,
you won't get anything from me.

157
00:10:10,610 --> 00:10:11,819
[Magbanua laughs]

158
00:10:11,902 --> 00:10:13,195
Stubborn, huh?

159
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:15,239
-Well, if that's it…
-[Magbanua sighs]

160
00:10:15,615 --> 00:10:16,407
[gun cocks]

161
00:10:19,076 --> 00:10:21,495
[phone buzzing]

162
00:10:22,163 --> 00:10:24,915
-[Magbanua sighs]
-[phone buzzing]

163
00:10:25,291 --> 00:10:26,292
[Damian] What's that?

164
00:10:26,667 --> 00:10:28,210
[phone buzzing]

165
00:10:29,253 --> 00:10:31,631
-[Damian] Let me check!
-Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

166
00:10:31,714 --> 00:10:33,507
-[phone buzzing]
-[Magbanua groans]

167
00:10:34,467 --> 00:10:36,218
[Magbanua breathing heavily]

168
00:10:36,302 --> 00:10:39,347
What's this? What are you hiding here?

169
00:10:39,430 --> 00:10:41,182
Did you exchange messages
with the Ardientes

170
00:10:41,265 --> 00:10:42,892
about where Lily and Camia are?

171
00:10:42,975 --> 00:10:44,226
Answer him!

172
00:10:46,228 --> 00:10:47,188
I don't know.

173
00:10:48,189 --> 00:10:52,693
-[Magbanua laughing]
-Nothing. Nothing? Nothing!

174
00:10:52,777 --> 00:10:53,736
[grunts]

175
00:10:56,781 --> 00:10:59,700
Are you sure you really
don't know anything?

176
00:11:01,786 --> 00:11:02,828
Nothing at all?

177
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:06,123
Hold on! Hold on! Give me his phone.

178
00:11:06,666 --> 00:11:09,710
[Magbanua breathing heavily]

179
00:11:12,380 --> 00:11:13,381
Hold still.

180
00:11:13,881 --> 00:11:16,092
[Magbanua] No. No.

181
00:11:16,175 --> 00:11:17,093
[Magbanua groans]

182
00:11:17,385 --> 00:11:18,386
[Magbanua] No!

183
00:11:18,844 --> 00:11:19,970
[Magbanua screaming]

184
00:11:22,473 --> 00:11:25,184
[Magbanua breathing heavily]

185
00:11:25,267 --> 00:11:27,812
[tense music playing]

186
00:11:33,025 --> 00:11:34,193
GO TO THE WAREHOUSE IN SITIO OTSO

187
00:11:34,276 --> 00:11:36,237
AND MAKE SURE THAT WOMAN
DOESN'T GET OUT.

188
00:11:36,987 --> 00:11:38,364
I don't think they're together.

189
00:11:38,989 --> 00:11:40,324
Only one address is mentioned here.

190
00:11:42,535 --> 00:11:44,120
Where is the other one?

191
00:11:46,997 --> 00:11:48,082
Answer me!

192
00:11:49,166 --> 00:11:50,751
[Magbanua] I was only ordered
to keep watch on you.

193
00:11:51,252 --> 00:11:53,254
I have no idea where Lily and Camia are.

194
00:11:53,337 --> 00:11:54,338
[laughs]

195
00:11:55,339 --> 00:11:57,383
[tense music playing]

196
00:11:59,927 --> 00:12:00,886
[Diego] Let's go.

197
00:12:00,970 --> 00:12:02,263
[Magbanua laughing]

198
00:12:02,346 --> 00:12:03,931
[screaming in pain]

199
00:12:04,515 --> 00:12:05,933
[groans]

200
00:12:08,310 --> 00:12:09,603
[Magbanua laughing]

201
00:12:15,317 --> 00:12:17,069
[tense music playing]

202
00:12:23,951 --> 00:12:26,120
<i>I need to be one step ahead</i>
<i>of the Ardientes.</i>

203
00:12:26,871 --> 00:12:29,999
<i>I don't have time to find an easy way out.</i>

204
00:12:33,836 --> 00:12:35,504
[tense music playing]

205
00:12:55,524 --> 00:12:56,525
[grunting]

206
00:13:03,741 --> 00:13:05,409
[tense music playing]

207
00:13:17,713 --> 00:13:18,631
[grunts]

208
00:13:53,082 --> 00:13:54,792
[tense music playing]

209
00:14:13,936 --> 00:14:15,563
[action music playing]

210
00:14:36,667 --> 00:14:38,252
[tense music playing]

211
00:14:51,682 --> 00:14:52,808
Something's wrong, Jepoy.

212
00:14:52,892 --> 00:14:55,436
Arnaldo hasn't answered any of my calls.

213
00:15:00,900 --> 00:15:02,443
[phone ringing]

214
00:15:02,526 --> 00:15:05,654
Excuse me. Oh, the idiots are calling.

215
00:15:08,782 --> 00:15:09,783
Anna?

216
00:15:10,576 --> 00:15:11,660
Arnaldo.

217
00:15:12,661 --> 00:15:14,496
Jepoy and I can't keep waiting.

218
00:15:14,580 --> 00:15:16,749
<i>With every minute,</i>
<i>Auntie Camia's and Lily's lives</i>

219
00:15:16,832 --> 00:15:18,000
<i>are in even more danger.</i>

220
00:15:18,918 --> 00:15:20,628
Have you heard anything
about where they are?

221
00:15:21,837 --> 00:15:23,005
Give me that.

222
00:15:24,173 --> 00:15:25,966
Where's Lily and Auntie Camia?

223
00:15:26,592 --> 00:15:29,637
Anna, Jepoy, I think I know where Lily is.

224
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:34,308
[brooding music playing]

225
00:15:36,769 --> 00:15:37,978
Thanks, Arnaldo.

226
00:15:39,063 --> 00:15:41,231
I'll text you her location, but don't tell

227
00:15:41,315 --> 00:15:43,359
anyone else, okay?
Don't bring anyone either.

228
00:15:47,738 --> 00:15:49,657
He said not to bring anyone else.

229
00:15:50,157 --> 00:15:50,950
He said that?

230
00:15:55,537 --> 00:15:57,331
And why did you do that?

231
00:15:57,665 --> 00:16:00,250
Did you hit your head again?
Are you trying to get caught?

232
00:16:01,001 --> 00:16:04,171
You're so mean. Please, I'm bored.

233
00:16:05,255 --> 00:16:06,840
I wanna be in this game too, like her.

234
00:16:07,716 --> 00:16:09,760
And if for some cosmic reason,
they came up with a

235
00:16:09,843 --> 00:16:10,928
plan to ruin our plan,

236
00:16:11,011 --> 00:16:13,222
at least I could tell you
in advance, right?

237
00:16:13,764 --> 00:16:14,932
It's like hitting two birds--

238
00:16:15,015 --> 00:16:17,851
Oh, no. Three birds with one stone.

239
00:16:20,062 --> 00:16:21,063
You are staying here.

240
00:16:21,146 --> 00:16:22,147
What if something happens to you?

241
00:16:22,231 --> 00:16:23,315
Grandpa.

242
00:16:23,399 --> 00:16:28,237
Emilia, let your son play with his toys.

243
00:16:28,696 --> 00:16:30,114
Besides, don't you want this?

244
00:16:30,197 --> 00:16:34,159
Now, we'll finally have eyes
where our cameras can't see.

245
00:16:34,660 --> 00:16:39,415
And besides, just in case
Lily Cruz is there…

246
00:16:42,376 --> 00:16:43,919
I know exactly what to do.

247
00:16:46,088 --> 00:16:47,798
[sinister music playing]

248
00:16:54,847 --> 00:16:57,599
[ominous music playing]

249
00:17:02,855 --> 00:17:04,523
[music continues]

250
00:17:23,042 --> 00:17:26,045
[sinister music playing]

251
00:17:34,553 --> 00:17:35,554
[beeps]

252
00:17:44,688 --> 00:17:45,606
[line ringing]

253
00:17:46,482 --> 00:17:47,399
Emilia.

254
00:17:47,483 --> 00:17:49,151
Oh, come on, Jaguar.

255
00:17:49,234 --> 00:17:50,652
You always call at the worst times.

256
00:17:51,528 --> 00:17:53,989
[Emilia] <i>Listen, I can't stay</i>
<i>on the line that long.</i>

257
00:17:54,073 --> 00:17:56,575
Because, as of now,
we're having a very big

258
00:17:56,658 --> 00:17:59,161
family emergency meeting.
Why did you call?

259
00:17:59,244 --> 00:18:01,330
<i>I just wanted to check…</i>

260
00:18:01,413 --> 00:18:02,539
if you were all right.

261
00:18:03,248 --> 00:18:05,751
I was just thinking
about your bullet wound.

262
00:18:05,834 --> 00:18:06,877
Has it healed yet?

263
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:09,630
That's really sweet of you,
but you have to remember

264
00:18:09,713 --> 00:18:12,257
that I'm a big girl already.
I can take care of myself.

265
00:18:14,885 --> 00:18:18,097
Well, Emilia, that's exactly
what I want to do.

266
00:18:19,139 --> 00:18:22,392
<i>I want to help you, take care of you.</i>

267
00:18:23,769 --> 00:18:26,688
And, more than anything, to support you

268
00:18:27,856 --> 00:18:30,109
with everything you're going through.

269
00:18:31,151 --> 00:18:33,737
If you will let me, that is.

270
00:18:36,073 --> 00:18:37,449
Okay, let's meet up.

271
00:18:49,628 --> 00:18:50,587
[exhales]

272
00:18:50,671 --> 00:18:52,339
[tense music playing]

273
00:19:02,182 --> 00:19:03,308
[Jepoy] Yeah, I'm here.

274
00:19:03,392 --> 00:19:05,811
[ominous music building]

275
00:19:06,103 --> 00:19:08,105
Anna, don't be stubborn.
This place is dangerous.

276
00:19:10,566 --> 00:19:11,400
Yeah, I'll be careful.

277
00:19:11,483 --> 00:19:13,402
We'll talk when I get back, okay?

278
00:19:15,654 --> 00:19:16,655
Bye.

279
00:19:26,748 --> 00:19:29,293
[ominous music playing]

280
00:19:32,087 --> 00:19:33,755
[tense music playing]

281
00:19:39,136 --> 00:19:40,137
Hey.

282
00:19:44,892 --> 00:19:47,728
Don't shoot, Jepoy. It's me.

283
00:19:48,937 --> 00:19:51,106
Why do you have a gun, Arnaldo?
Where did you get that?

284
00:19:52,900 --> 00:19:54,484
I found it upstairs.

285
00:19:56,528 --> 00:19:57,613
Is he still alive?

286
00:19:59,615 --> 00:20:00,616
Yeah.

287
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:02,784
Can I keep this?

288
00:20:02,868 --> 00:20:03,911
Wait, where is Anna?

289
00:20:05,871 --> 00:20:08,123
I won't take Anna here.
It's too dangerous.

290
00:20:12,294 --> 00:20:13,503
Where is Lily?

291
00:20:13,921 --> 00:20:15,756
[stutters] I don't know
what happened, either.

292
00:20:15,839 --> 00:20:17,466
All I know is they were brought here.

293
00:20:20,177 --> 00:20:23,096
We better look for them. They
should be around here somewhere.

294
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:27,601
Come on!

295
00:20:28,644 --> 00:20:30,270
[tense music playing]

296
00:20:49,414 --> 00:20:51,083
[tense music playing]

297
00:21:14,064 --> 00:21:15,732
[tense music playing]

298
00:21:21,071 --> 00:21:22,739
[melancholic music playing]

299
00:21:39,256 --> 00:21:41,174
[Camia] <i>You monsters!</i>

300
00:21:43,927 --> 00:21:45,595
<i>What are you going to do to me?</i>

301
00:21:46,096 --> 00:21:47,222
Mom!

302
00:21:52,436 --> 00:21:54,062
[tense music playing]

303
00:21:56,940 --> 00:22:01,278
<i>God, please lead me to where my mother is.</i>

304
00:22:05,949 --> 00:22:10,078
<i>Mom, I'll protect you</i>
<i>until my last breath.</i>

305
00:22:10,829 --> 00:22:14,875
<i>I'll save you from Helena</i>
<i>and the Ardientes.</i>

306
00:22:17,836 --> 00:22:19,588
[tense music playing]

307
00:22:40,108 --> 00:22:41,860
[Emilia] Oh my God, Jaguar.

308
00:22:41,943 --> 00:22:43,779
You'd better be here and show up

309
00:22:43,862 --> 00:22:47,282
because I had to sneak out
just to see you.

310
00:22:48,408 --> 00:22:50,077
[tense music playing]

311
00:22:52,412 --> 00:22:53,413
Raul?

312
00:22:54,206 --> 00:22:55,332
What are you doing here?

313
00:22:55,415 --> 00:22:57,876
What about you,
what are you doing here, huh?

314
00:22:58,794 --> 00:23:01,171
Are you here to meet with your accomplice?

315
00:23:01,254 --> 00:23:02,089
Where is Diego?

316
00:23:02,589 --> 00:23:03,799
It's none of your business.

317
00:23:03,882 --> 00:23:05,467
You followed me here, didn't you?

318
00:23:05,550 --> 00:23:07,385
I didn't follow you. Where's Diego?

319
00:23:07,469 --> 00:23:08,720
Where's my son? Where is he?

320
00:23:08,804 --> 00:23:11,098
Let go of me, Raul! Let go of me!

321
00:23:11,598 --> 00:23:13,558
-Bring out my son.
-Let go of me.

322
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:18,939
Why, Emilia? Are you going to kill me?

323
00:23:19,022 --> 00:23:20,023
Can you do it?

324
00:23:20,690 --> 00:23:23,110
Emilia, you've threatened me
countless times.

325
00:23:23,568 --> 00:23:24,861
But I'm still alive.

326
00:23:25,487 --> 00:23:26,321
You want to know why?

327
00:23:26,404 --> 00:23:28,740
You can't kill me because you love me.

328
00:23:29,199 --> 00:23:31,118
And that's your weakness.

329
00:23:31,409 --> 00:23:33,245
After everything, Raul?

330
00:23:33,328 --> 00:23:34,704
After everything we've been through,

331
00:23:34,788 --> 00:23:37,624
you'll still choose
your bastard son over me?

332
00:23:38,333 --> 00:23:42,045
I keep giving you chances, Raul,
but time and time again,

333
00:23:42,129 --> 00:23:45,132
you keep showing me
you don't deserve to live!

334
00:23:45,674 --> 00:23:47,884
You were the ones who
brought Lily and Camia Cruz

335
00:23:47,968 --> 00:23:49,094
into our lives!

336
00:23:49,553 --> 00:23:52,639
Those people keep making
my family's life miserable.

337
00:23:52,722 --> 00:23:54,683
They keep making my life miserable!

338
00:23:54,766 --> 00:23:56,685
It's all your fault, Raul!
It's all your fault!

339
00:24:01,648 --> 00:24:02,649
Fine.

340
00:24:03,316 --> 00:24:05,068
It's my fault, I admit it.

341
00:24:06,444 --> 00:24:08,613
But I paid for it a long time ago.

342
00:24:09,698 --> 00:24:11,158
I've more than made up for it.

343
00:24:11,950 --> 00:24:14,911
When my son and I moved into your house,

344
00:24:14,995 --> 00:24:16,580
my life became a living hell.

345
00:24:17,455 --> 00:24:19,583
But I put up with all of you.
You know why?

346
00:24:19,666 --> 00:24:22,335
Because I wanted to be powerful like you.

347
00:24:22,419 --> 00:24:25,797
The Ardientes. Because I knew I would need

348
00:24:25,881 --> 00:24:29,593
to protect my son someday
from monsters like you!

349
00:24:29,676 --> 00:24:32,929
I will kill you, Raul!
I will kill you and your son!

350
00:24:33,013 --> 00:24:34,306
You don't need to kill me anymore.

351
00:24:35,015 --> 00:24:36,850
Because I've been mourning my death

352
00:24:38,059 --> 00:24:40,020
from the day we got married, Emilia.

353
00:24:40,520 --> 00:24:42,981
[somber music playing]

354
00:24:44,691 --> 00:24:47,736
I turned into a monster because
of my love for you, Raul.

355
00:24:47,819 --> 00:24:51,198
Well, sorry. You married me, remember?

356
00:24:51,281 --> 00:24:52,490
I never loved you.

357
00:24:54,618 --> 00:24:56,703
Even then, I knew
you weren't worthy of my love.

358
00:24:58,455 --> 00:25:00,498
Don't you dare come near me, Raul.

359
00:25:00,582 --> 00:25:01,708
Don't you dare come near me

360
00:25:01,791 --> 00:25:05,378
because you and your son
are about to meet again in hell.

361
00:25:06,171 --> 00:25:08,006
Don't you dare follow me, Raul.

362
00:25:19,851 --> 00:25:22,145
[Damian groaning]

363
00:25:29,361 --> 00:25:30,570
[exhales]

364
00:25:30,654 --> 00:25:32,948
[tense music playing]

365
00:25:46,169 --> 00:25:48,630
There aren't a lot of guards.
I'm going in.

366
00:25:48,713 --> 00:25:50,090
I'm coming with you.

367
00:25:50,173 --> 00:25:52,592
You sure you can do it?
You're hurt pretty bad.

368
00:25:53,093 --> 00:25:54,177
I can do it.

369
00:25:56,429 --> 00:25:57,430
Use this.

370
00:26:03,937 --> 00:26:06,064
[phone buzzing]

371
00:26:07,816 --> 00:26:08,942
[phone buzzing]

372
00:26:09,484 --> 00:26:10,443
Hello, Dad?

373
00:26:11,653 --> 00:26:13,405
Diego? Diego, where are you?

374
00:26:14,072 --> 00:26:16,700
The Ardientes have Lily and Auntie Camia.

375
00:26:16,992 --> 00:26:19,119
I'm with Mister Damian.
We're going to rescue them.

376
00:26:19,369 --> 00:26:20,578
<i>Son, it's too dangerous.</i>

377
00:26:20,662 --> 00:26:22,580
They will kill you.

378
00:26:22,664 --> 00:26:24,916
We need to meet so I can help you.

379
00:26:28,837 --> 00:26:31,589
I'll send you the location.
We'll meet you here.

380
00:26:32,841 --> 00:26:34,050
Okay. Be careful.

381
00:26:40,098 --> 00:26:41,808
[tense music playing]

382
00:26:47,689 --> 00:26:49,524
Damn you, Raul.

383
00:26:50,692 --> 00:26:55,322
I will make sure your bastard son dies!

384
00:26:56,072 --> 00:26:57,282
Damn you!

385
00:26:58,783 --> 00:26:59,909
[sobbing]

386
00:27:22,140 --> 00:27:23,391
-Diego.
-Dad.

387
00:27:26,102 --> 00:27:28,813
Raul, are you sure you're ready
to go against the Ardientes?

388
00:27:29,814 --> 00:27:32,275
For my son.
I'm willing to do it for my son.

389
00:27:35,320 --> 00:27:37,030
[tense music playing]

390
00:28:04,641 --> 00:28:06,935
Now you're the true, one and only Jaguar.

391
00:28:09,604 --> 00:28:11,189
I worked for Red Dragon once,

392
00:28:11,272 --> 00:28:13,400
but I turned my back
on that life a long time ago.

393
00:28:14,526 --> 00:28:17,612
Mister Damian, thank you
for helping me fight

394
00:28:17,695 --> 00:28:18,863
Red Dragon's minions.

395
00:28:19,322 --> 00:28:20,990
Thank you for rescuing my son.

396
00:28:21,074 --> 00:28:23,118
I don't deserve your gratitude

397
00:28:23,201 --> 00:28:25,453
because I've hurt Camia and Lily
so many times.

398
00:28:26,746 --> 00:28:29,249
We should just work together to find them.

399
00:28:32,836 --> 00:28:35,004
Use that mask to right what's wrong.

400
00:28:36,047 --> 00:28:37,507
[ominous music playing]

401
00:28:53,690 --> 00:28:55,358
[action music playing]

402
00:28:57,777 --> 00:28:59,404
I'll call you two once I find them.

403
00:29:02,073 --> 00:29:04,367
Dad, please be careful.

404
00:29:07,495 --> 00:29:08,538
Damian.

405
00:29:11,082 --> 00:29:12,792
[action music playing]

406
00:29:36,858 --> 00:29:39,110
Emilia, is everything okay?

407
00:29:39,194 --> 00:29:40,904
[Julio] Emilia, what's wrong with you?

408
00:29:40,987 --> 00:29:44,115
Why did you leave without telling us?

409
00:29:44,699 --> 00:29:45,825
I'm okay, Mama.

410
00:29:45,909 --> 00:29:47,535
Sorry, I just had to fix something.

411
00:29:48,119 --> 00:29:49,829
[tense music playing]

412
00:29:54,083 --> 00:29:55,919
Clear. The entrance is clear.

413
00:29:59,422 --> 00:30:01,090
[tense music playing]

414
00:30:19,984 --> 00:30:22,070
What the hell is Jaguar doing there?

415
00:30:29,410 --> 00:30:32,247
You two aren't good with cats, are you?

416
00:30:32,330 --> 00:30:34,207
Looks like you both
got clawed in the face.

417
00:30:39,796 --> 00:30:41,464
[tense music playing]

418
00:30:47,762 --> 00:30:49,389
-[goon] Hey!
-[gunshots]

419
00:30:59,440 --> 00:31:00,525
The intruder's here!

420
00:31:06,948 --> 00:31:08,616
[tense music playing]

421
00:31:13,288 --> 00:31:14,372
What?!

422
00:31:17,083 --> 00:31:18,710
[tense music playing]

423
00:31:44,068 --> 00:31:46,404
[tense music playing]

424
00:31:53,828 --> 00:31:54,787
[gunshots]

425
00:32:00,460 --> 00:32:01,461
[goon] What was that?

426
00:32:07,717 --> 00:32:08,843
[gunshots]

427
00:32:09,260 --> 00:32:10,720
-Gunshots?
-Let's go. Let's go.

428
00:32:10,803 --> 00:32:11,804
Let's go.

429
00:32:15,892 --> 00:32:17,560
[action music playing]

430
00:32:24,150 --> 00:32:25,151
What's this?

431
00:32:25,777 --> 00:32:28,947
That's impossible. Damian is dead.

432
00:32:29,447 --> 00:32:31,616
I saw Diego kill Damian myself.

433
00:32:32,033 --> 00:32:32,867
Dad.

434
00:32:34,160 --> 00:32:36,371
You two go upstairs. I'll search here.

435
00:32:40,500 --> 00:32:42,168
[tense music playing]

436
00:32:45,338 --> 00:32:46,506
Keep an eye on her.

437
00:32:47,090 --> 00:32:48,257
[goon] Yes, Boss. I got this.

438
00:32:51,219 --> 00:32:52,929
[tense music playing]

439
00:33:00,937 --> 00:33:01,938
[Emilia sighs]

440
00:33:07,068 --> 00:33:08,319
Of all the blasted--

441
00:33:08,987 --> 00:33:12,865
How many lives does
that damn Cruz family have?!

442
00:33:13,199 --> 00:33:17,453
From the mother to the uncle
and down to the daughter,

443
00:33:17,537 --> 00:33:19,747
it's like they've all got nine lives!

444
00:33:20,081 --> 00:33:22,917
I won't let those lowlifes outsmart us.

445
00:33:23,001 --> 00:33:25,003
We are the predators and not them!

446
00:33:25,086 --> 00:33:26,963
Oh, yeah. Look what's happening.

447
00:33:32,051 --> 00:33:33,720
[action music playing]

448
00:33:34,429 --> 00:33:37,306
[Damian] Diego, check upstairs.
I'll look here. Go.

449
00:33:42,395 --> 00:33:44,063
[action music playing]

450
00:33:52,822 --> 00:33:55,366
Lily? Auntie Camia?

451
00:34:02,498 --> 00:34:04,167
[tense music playing]

452
00:34:16,846 --> 00:34:17,805
[Damian] Camia!

453
00:34:22,977 --> 00:34:24,479
[sinister music playing]

454
00:34:26,022 --> 00:34:27,023
Lily!

455
00:34:28,316 --> 00:34:29,442
Lily!

456
00:34:30,359 --> 00:34:32,153
-Lily!
-Hey, shut up!

457
00:34:33,321 --> 00:34:34,322
Lily!

458
00:34:37,950 --> 00:34:39,619
[tense music playing]

459
00:34:44,624 --> 00:34:46,292
[goon grunting]

460
00:34:55,760 --> 00:34:56,761
Damian?

461
00:35:06,854 --> 00:35:09,232
Damn you, Jaguar!

462
00:35:16,531 --> 00:35:18,074
I'm going to kill you.

463
00:35:19,909 --> 00:35:21,661
I'll kill you!

464
00:35:21,744 --> 00:35:23,454
-Emilia? Emilia!
-Emilia!

465
00:35:23,538 --> 00:35:24,455
Emilia!

466
00:35:26,124 --> 00:35:27,834
[tense music playing]

467
00:35:30,962 --> 00:35:32,296
[chains rattling]

468
00:35:35,758 --> 00:35:37,635
Damian, I'm so glad you're here.

469
00:35:43,891 --> 00:35:45,560
[suspenseful music playing]

470
00:36:05,955 --> 00:36:07,957
Camia, please let me make it up to you.

471
00:36:09,750 --> 00:36:11,794
Wait, there are two Jaguars?

472
00:36:12,295 --> 00:36:14,547
It doesn't matter
how many Jaguars there are.

473
00:36:14,922 --> 00:36:17,175
What matters now is your safety. Come on.

474
00:36:18,426 --> 00:36:21,554
What about my daughter?
We have to save Lily.

475
00:36:22,221 --> 00:36:25,349
I'm with Damian and Diego.
They're looking for her.

476
00:36:26,267 --> 00:36:27,435
Let's go, Camia.

477
00:36:33,357 --> 00:36:34,984
<i>I said take your hands off me!</i>

478
00:36:35,067 --> 00:36:38,279
<i>Sir! Don't touch me!</i>
<i>Sir! Let me go! Let me go!</i>

479
00:36:38,738 --> 00:36:40,990
<i>You'll all pay for this!</i>

480
00:36:41,073 --> 00:36:44,702
<i>Locking me up all those years</i>
<i>wasn't "saving" me.</i>

481
00:36:45,161 --> 00:36:49,749
<i>You're the root of all</i>
<i>my family's misfortunes!</i>

482
00:36:49,832 --> 00:36:52,168
<i>You robbed me of my life!</i>

483
00:36:54,754 --> 00:36:56,422
Raul, why are you doing this?

484
00:36:57,632 --> 00:37:00,676
Camia, let me make up
for everything I've done.

485
00:37:04,222 --> 00:37:05,806
Let's go. We don't have much time.

486
00:37:17,026 --> 00:37:18,736
[tense music playing]

487
00:37:21,113 --> 00:37:24,075
Hey! Where do you think you're going?

488
00:37:35,378 --> 00:37:37,171
[tense music playing]

489
00:37:43,344 --> 00:37:45,388
Drop it! Put it down.

490
00:37:52,561 --> 00:37:54,689
Lily, Auntie Camia.

491
00:37:59,402 --> 00:38:00,361
[grunting]

492
00:38:06,075 --> 00:38:08,828
[gunshots]

493
00:38:14,208 --> 00:38:15,918
[tense music playing]

494
00:38:22,174 --> 00:38:23,884
[ominous music playing]

495
00:38:33,102 --> 00:38:34,020
-Camia.
-Damian.

496
00:38:34,103 --> 00:38:35,563
Thank goodness you're safe.

497
00:38:37,773 --> 00:38:39,734
Where's Lily? Where's my daughter?

498
00:38:40,067 --> 00:38:42,528
Diego and I searched the whole place,
but if you're the only one here,

499
00:38:42,611 --> 00:38:44,655
then that means
they hid Lily somewhere else.

500
00:38:45,364 --> 00:38:47,408
Damian, we have to find Lily.

501
00:38:47,783 --> 00:38:49,660
The Ardientes are going to kill her.

502
00:38:50,036 --> 00:38:51,454
We have to hurry. Time's running out.

503
00:38:51,537 --> 00:38:52,788
Let's go out the back.

504
00:38:53,998 --> 00:38:57,793
[goon] Hurry up! The prisoner has escaped!

505
00:38:58,961 --> 00:39:00,463
This way. This way.

506
00:39:08,387 --> 00:39:11,057
The prisoner has escaped! Did you see her?

507
00:39:11,140 --> 00:39:12,266
[goon 2] She's not at the back.

508
00:39:12,933 --> 00:39:15,519
You two, search the back again!
You two, come with me!

509
00:39:17,897 --> 00:39:19,565
[tense music playing]

510
00:39:22,860 --> 00:39:25,404
They're heading out back.
Let's go through the front.

511
00:39:25,738 --> 00:39:27,365
Come on. Let's go, come on.

512
00:39:35,331 --> 00:39:37,041
[tense music playing]

513
00:39:44,382 --> 00:39:46,133
[cocks gun] What happened?

514
00:39:46,217 --> 00:39:47,927
We heard gunshots inside, Madam.

515
00:39:48,010 --> 00:39:50,554
And you're out here standing?!
Out of my way!

516
00:39:56,519 --> 00:39:57,937
What? You let them get away too?

517
00:39:58,437 --> 00:40:00,481
You're such an idiot! Come on, let's go!

518
00:40:00,564 --> 00:40:01,690
Sorry, boss.

519
00:40:03,234 --> 00:40:04,944
[tense music playing]

520
00:40:10,324 --> 00:40:11,617
[Emilia] What happened here?

521
00:40:15,454 --> 00:40:17,790
Idiots, every single one of you!

522
00:40:17,873 --> 00:40:22,128
You two, stand guard here!
Got it? You're all so stupid!

523
00:40:22,420 --> 00:40:24,547
I'm sure they haven't
gotten away yet, ma'am.

524
00:40:24,630 --> 00:40:25,714
Shut up!

525
00:40:26,257 --> 00:40:30,219
So, Helena, are you ready to watch

526
00:40:30,302 --> 00:40:34,932
Emilia make a fool
out of herself for the nth time?

527
00:40:36,016 --> 00:40:38,561
You know, she's always been a failure.

528
00:40:39,437 --> 00:40:41,147
But I'm used to it by now.

529
00:40:43,899 --> 00:40:45,526
[tense music playing]

530
00:40:58,706 --> 00:41:00,249
[tense music playing]

531
00:41:17,766 --> 00:41:19,310
[tense music playing]

532
00:41:31,739 --> 00:41:35,242
The only good thing is that
I am always ready.

533
00:41:35,993 --> 00:41:38,996
So, if anything goes wrong,
I have a plan B,

534
00:41:39,288 --> 00:41:43,292
I have a plan C, and I have got plans up

535
00:41:43,375 --> 00:41:47,922
to the letter Z just to get the job done.

536
00:41:51,008 --> 00:41:52,134
What do you think you're doing?

537
00:41:53,093 --> 00:41:55,554
Doing what you women can't -- my best.

538
00:41:57,556 --> 00:41:58,557
What do you think you're doing?

539
00:41:59,475 --> 00:42:02,394
Helena, give me back my phone.

540
00:42:02,478 --> 00:42:04,104
Come and get me if you can, Julio.

541
00:42:04,188 --> 00:42:05,523
No, give me back my phone.

542
00:42:05,606 --> 00:42:07,483
Oops! My bad.

543
00:42:14,073 --> 00:42:15,950
Who's in control now, huh, Julio?

544
00:42:16,492 --> 00:42:20,621
[scoffs] Like I told you.
My game, my rules!

545
00:42:21,705 --> 00:42:22,748
I'm telling you, Helena.

546
00:42:23,123 --> 00:42:26,919
If there's one thing that's
dangerous in this world…

547
00:42:29,088 --> 00:42:30,965
it's a humiliated man!

548
00:42:35,094 --> 00:42:36,095
[Julio groans]

549
00:42:38,097 --> 00:42:39,306
You're wrong, Julio.

550
00:42:39,848 --> 00:42:43,561
There is something more
dangerous than a humiliated man!

551
00:42:45,521 --> 00:42:47,189
It's a vengeful woman!

552
00:42:47,606 --> 00:42:48,899
[Helena shouting]

553
00:42:52,236 --> 00:42:54,280
[laughing]

554
00:42:54,863 --> 00:42:56,532
[sinister music playing]

555
00:42:57,866 --> 00:43:00,494
[laughing]

556
00:43:09,086 --> 00:43:10,629
[tense music playing]

557
00:43:30,065 --> 00:43:32,526
Damian, where's Diego?

558
00:43:33,736 --> 00:43:34,862
Where is he?

559
00:43:35,154 --> 00:43:36,947
I'll be the one to look for him.

560
00:43:37,489 --> 00:43:39,700
Damian, you take care of Camia.

561
00:43:40,909 --> 00:43:42,077
I'm out of bullets.

562
00:43:43,162 --> 00:43:44,663
But I'll manage. Now, go.

563
00:43:45,122 --> 00:43:46,123
[Raul grunts]

564
00:43:50,377 --> 00:43:51,545
I'm out of bullets too.

565
00:43:55,132 --> 00:43:56,091
Come on, let's go.

566
00:43:56,175 --> 00:43:58,177
[Emilia shouting] You're all so stupid!

567
00:43:58,636 --> 00:43:59,595
[Damian mumbling quietly]

568
00:43:59,678 --> 00:44:01,347
[unsettling music]

569
00:44:07,728 --> 00:44:08,729
[Damian grunts]

570
00:44:20,074 --> 00:44:22,993
What happened?
How the hell did they get away?

571
00:44:23,744 --> 00:44:25,371
Someone helped the prisoner escape, ma'am.

572
00:44:26,163 --> 00:44:28,332
Go back and get reinforcements!
And make it quick!

573
00:44:28,832 --> 00:44:32,127
You're all so stupid!
And what are you doing there?

574
00:44:32,211 --> 00:44:35,506
Search the whole area! You useless idiots!

575
00:44:35,589 --> 00:44:37,299
Why are you still standing there?

576
00:44:44,056 --> 00:44:44,973
Camia?

577
00:44:47,142 --> 00:44:48,185
Damian?

578
00:44:49,061 --> 00:44:53,273
Yoo-hoo. Where are you two?

579
00:44:54,483 --> 00:44:56,068
Now, don't test me.

580
00:44:57,069 --> 00:44:58,946
I'm getting impatient!

581
00:45:00,072 --> 00:45:01,115
[Emilia shouting] Camia!

582
00:45:01,198 --> 00:45:02,408
[phone ringing]

583
00:45:04,910 --> 00:45:05,828
Yes, Mama?

584
00:45:05,911 --> 00:45:07,830
Emilia, go to your right.

585
00:45:08,664 --> 00:45:10,124
Your right, behind the crates.

586
00:45:11,083 --> 00:45:13,627
[suspenseful music playing]

587
00:45:17,214 --> 00:45:20,259
Camia Cruz is there
with the two prodigal Jaguars.

588
00:45:21,051 --> 00:45:22,052
Go get them.

589
00:45:22,511 --> 00:45:24,680
Thanks, Mama. You're the best.

590
00:45:27,266 --> 00:45:29,351
[laughing]

591
00:45:30,477 --> 00:45:34,148
Of all the places to hide.
Come on out of there!

592
00:45:34,773 --> 00:45:36,275
Camia, Damian, out!

593
00:45:38,944 --> 00:45:41,238
My patience is wearing thin.

594
00:45:41,864 --> 00:45:43,407
I don't like waiting!

595
00:45:44,158 --> 00:45:45,075
One!

596
00:45:45,159 --> 00:45:46,160
[gunshot]

597
00:45:48,412 --> 00:45:49,997
-Two!
-[gunshot]

598
00:45:52,833 --> 00:45:54,460
-Three!
-[Raul grunts]

599
00:45:58,922 --> 00:46:00,257
Let go, Jaguar!

600
00:46:00,716 --> 00:46:02,009
[Emilia struggling]

601
00:46:02,092 --> 00:46:03,469
You traitor!

602
00:46:04,470 --> 00:46:06,305
[tense music playing]

603
00:46:15,898 --> 00:46:16,899
[gunshot]

604
00:46:20,903 --> 00:46:22,529
[Jaguar breathing heavily]

605
00:46:26,158 --> 00:46:27,868
[somber music playing]

606
00:46:41,757 --> 00:46:43,509
-[Raul groans]
-I'm going to kill you!

607
00:46:44,968 --> 00:46:46,220
Emilia…

608
00:46:47,429 --> 00:46:49,139
[Raul groans, coughs]

609
00:46:49,223 --> 00:46:51,892
[dramatic music playing]

610
00:47:03,695 --> 00:47:04,696
[Raul groans]

611
00:47:05,322 --> 00:47:06,949
[sobbing]

612
00:47:16,333 --> 00:47:21,380
[dramatic music playing]

613
00:47:24,508 --> 00:47:26,093
[screaming]

614
00:47:27,594 --> 00:47:31,098
[Emilia screaming] Raul!

615
00:47:32,099 --> 00:47:33,308
[Emilia wailing]

616
00:47:42,192 --> 00:47:43,860
[tense music playing]

617
00:47:43,944 --> 00:47:46,780
[sobbing] Raul!

618
00:47:53,912 --> 00:47:56,623
<i>Arnaldo, I've searched the whole place,</i>
<i>but they aren't here.</i>

619
00:47:56,707 --> 00:47:58,917
<i>Do you think I'm stupid? Where are they?</i>

620
00:47:59,543 --> 00:48:02,796
<i>Please forgive me for failing</i>
<i>to give you a good life, son.</i>

621
00:48:02,879 --> 00:48:05,090
<i>You killed everyone I love!</i>

622
00:48:06,466 --> 00:48:08,302
<i>What a surprise to see you, Lily Cruz!</i>

623
00:48:08,385 --> 00:48:10,596
-[gunshot]
-[Emilia] <i>Before this night is over,</i>

624
00:48:10,679 --> 00:48:12,556
<i>I'll have my revenge on you</i>
<i>and your daughter!</i>

625
00:48:12,639 --> 00:48:14,474
<i>No matter how many times</i>
<i>you try to bury us,</i>

626
00:48:14,558 --> 00:48:16,226
<i>we'll always come back to haunt you!</i>

627
00:48:16,310 --> 00:48:19,271
<i>I can't wait to kill all you Ardientes!</i>

628
00:48:19,354 --> 00:48:21,106
<i>Did I stress you out?</i>

629
00:48:21,189 --> 00:48:22,399
[Lily] <i>Emilia!</i>

630
00:48:22,482 --> 00:48:25,902
<i>If you kill my mother, I'll kill yours!</i>

631
00:48:25,986 --> 00:48:28,697
[theme music playing]
